    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The final report concludes &#x201c;Overall one can conclude that during the period 2013-2017 the TT has functioned at a good level. It has provided benefits to its participants; outcome of processes are generally considered as legitimate; and the structure of the three Co-chairs helps to bring different perspectives to the fore, and also contributes to legitimacy.&#x201d;
